The graph shown is a closed round curve, but its centre is not at the origin. Name the family this graph belongs to and write the general form of the equation that produces it.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[->] (-1,0)--(4.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-1)--(0,4.2) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue] (2,2) circle (1.4);
\fill (2,2) circle (0.05);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
